{
  "name": "Arrmada alerts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Arrmada alerts\n1. Open **Arrmada alert** and copy its **Production URL**.\n2. In Arrmada: Settings → Alerts → Add alert → **n8n / Webhook**. Paste the URL, copy the signing secret, tick the events, then Add.\n3. Open **Sign it the same way**, create a Crypto credential and paste the signing secret as its **Hmac Secret**.\n4. Publish (activate) this workflow, then press **Send test** in Arrmada.\n\nEach branch gets the alert as JSON: `event`, `title`, `message`, `url`, `data`. Replace the placeholder steps with Discord, Google Sheets, a script — anything.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "e772215e-67b0-455f-8fba-978a93447e12",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-560, -260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "arrmada",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e0aee1fc-cdf1-43bd-95b4-14867e8509a8",
      "name": "Arrmada alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-80, 60],
      "webhookId": "938c252c-1eec-4e9d-8e1e-e38a8627fd34"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hmac",
        "type": "SHA256",
        "value": "={{ $json.headers['x-arrmada-timestamp'] }}.{{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "dataPropertyName": "expected_signature",
        "encoding": "hex"
      },
      "id": "5660e330-6f9c-48f2-bf7c-b0591572dba6",
      "name": "Sign it the same way",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [140, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "04aa1ecb-c6d9-47d7-aaae-3d5152318afa",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers['x-arrmada-signature'] }}",
              "rightValue": "=sha256={{ $json.expected_signature }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "2a884a2a-8e99-4d42-b337-447c5d78a1ae",
              "leftValue": "={{ Math.abs($now.toSeconds() - Number($json.headers['x-arrmada-timestamp'])) }}",
              "rightValue": 300,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6da59835-c473-44ef-a701-a6e7abd54774",
      "name": "From Arrmada, and recent?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [360, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Pass on just the alert itself (the request's headers aren't needed past here).\nreturn $input.all().map((item) => ({ json: item.json.body }));\n"
